If a metaphor can’t survive translation:

\text{METAPHOR ONLY}.

If it specifies behavior but lacks testing:

\text{MECHANISM CANDIDATE}.

If it executes:

\text{IMPLEMENTED}.

If it survives evidence:

\boxed{\text{REFINED}}

That prevents the Moneybin from filling with shiny rocks mislabeled gold.

